♪ What is most unforgettable? ♪

386
00:30:09,770 --> 00:30:10,500
Wu Dingyuan.

387
00:30:11,210 --> 00:30:12,120
Stop resting.

388
00:30:12,340 --> 00:30:14,070
They will definitely catch up.

389
00:30:14,120 --> 00:30:15,580
We need to leave right now.

390
00:30:15,660 --> 00:30:16,200
Let's go.

391
00:30:20,900 --> 00:30:21,720
Good-for-nothing!

392
00:30:21,720 --> 00:30:23,640
Stop yelling, Big Radish.

393
00:30:24,470 --> 00:30:25,460
What did you call me?

394
00:30:25,460 --> 00:30:26,460
Big Radish.

395
00:30:27,440 --> 00:30:28,300
Your Highness.

396
00:30:33,030 --> 00:30:34,030
Where should we go

397
00:30:34,100 --> 00:30:34,950
now?

398
00:30:36,620 --> 00:30:37,470
Head north.

399
00:30:38,750 --> 00:30:41,120
Zhengyang Gate is at
the southernmost part of Jinling City.

400
00:30:41,120 --> 00:30:43,050
You're heading back into the city?

401
00:30:43,590 --> 00:30:45,190
They definitely won't guess

402
00:30:45,570 --> 00:30:46,830
that we're going back.

403
00:30:47,660 --> 00:30:48,680
If we head south now,

404
00:30:48,680 --> 00:30:50,610
it will surely be heavily guarded.

405
00:30:50,920 --> 00:30:53,180
But we must have a specific destination.

406
00:30:53,990 --> 00:30:55,650
You'll know when we get there.

407
00:31:20,530 --> 00:31:26,660
[Iron Alliance's Liang Xingfu]

408
00:31:22,200 --> 00:31:23,440
Iron Lion.

409
00:31:24,870 --> 00:31:25,920
I'm late.

410
00:31:38,120 --> 00:31:38,850
Uncle Liang.

411
00:31:41,310 --> 00:31:43,070
When Iron Lion died,

412
00:31:44,440 --> 00:31:46,100
he was held in someone's arms.

413
00:31:50,030 --> 00:31:52,070
You and Wu Buping are old acquaintances.

414
00:31:52,070 --> 00:31:54,500
Whether you want to bury his corpse
in the green mountains or desecrate it

415
00:31:54,500 --> 00:31:56,380
to vent your anger—I leave it up to you.

416
00:31:56,380 --> 00:31:58,710
I have to go back
and send someone to report to the Chief.

417
00:31:58,710 --> 00:32:01,910
Remember to help me find
the Crown Prince's whereabouts.

418
00:32:05,160 --> 00:32:05,750
He Si!

419
00:32:18,480 --> 00:32:23,830
[Zhu Gaoxu, Prince Han]

420
00:32:25,420 --> 00:32:26,400
Somebody!

421
00:32:26,880 --> 00:32:28,880
Think you're feeding a cat or a bird?

422
00:32:28,920 --> 00:32:30,290
I'm not full!

423
00:32:30,530 --> 00:32:32,010
Bring me more food!

424
00:32:32,910 --> 00:32:33,810
Hurry up!

425
00:32:36,380 --> 00:32:37,340
Your Highness,

426
00:32:37,580 --> 00:32:39,640
Her Majesty requests your presence.

427
00:32:51,120 --> 00:32:52,050
Prince Han,

428
00:32:52,570 --> 00:32:54,180
I'm perplexed.

429
00:32:55,010 --> 00:32:56,470
Are we leaving you thirsty

430
00:32:56,900 --> 00:32:58,140
or starving?

431
00:32:59,350 --> 00:33:00,440
His Majesty is ill.

432
00:33:01,290 --> 00:33:02,480
The chief officials of all ministries

433
00:33:02,480 --> 00:33:04,610
are waiting on him here in Qin'an Hall.

434
00:33:05,140 --> 00:33:07,200
Why are you, his own brother,

435
00:33:07,940 --> 00:33:09,800
unable to stay quiet for a moment?

436
00:33:10,290 --> 00:33:11,010
Perfect.

437
00:33:12,080 --> 00:33:14,080
I'd like to ask you, Sister-in-law—

438
00:33:14,250 --> 00:33:16,730
are the affairs of our Zhu family now

439
00:33:16,810 --> 00:33:19,770
decided by you, an outsider?

440
00:33:20,880 --> 00:33:23,230
The affairs of the Zhu family
you mentioned—

441
00:33:23,230 --> 00:33:25,750
are they state affairs or family affairs?

442
00:33:27,280 --> 00:33:28,830
Let's not talk about state affairs,

443
00:33:28,830 --> 00:33:30,130
just family affairs.

444
00:33:31,030 --> 00:33:32,380
In ordinary families,

445
00:33:32,730 --> 00:33:36,260
sons have to establish
their own households after they grow up.

446
00:33:36,360 --> 00:33:38,530
If I remember correctly,

447
00:33:39,310 --> 00:33:43,570
you went to Le'an
to take up your fief

448
00:33:44,210 --> 00:33:46,070
in the 15th year of Yongle, right?

449
00:33:47,160 --> 00:33:49,690
Then what do His Majesty's
family affairs now

450
00:33:50,050 --> 00:33:52,050
have to do with you?

451
00:33:52,370 --> 00:33:53,910
Does Your Majesty think

452
00:33:54,160 --> 00:33:55,900
that after I took up my fief,

453
00:33:56,290 --> 00:33:58,530
I am only His Majesty's subject

454
00:33:59,440 --> 00:34:01,530
and no longer his brother?

455
00:34:02,400 --> 00:34:03,640
I remember Your Majesty

456
00:34:03,640 --> 00:34:06,730
became the Princess Consort of Yan
in the 28th year of Hongwu.

457
00:34:06,730 --> 00:34:07,810
Up to today,

458
00:34:08,010 --> 00:34:09,469
you have only been married to His Majesty

459
00:34:09,469 --> 00:34:11,460
for 30 years.

460
00:34:11,900 --> 00:34:13,010
But I

461
00:34:13,360 --> 00:34:17,820
have been His Majesty's brother
for 45 years.

462
00:34:18,030 --> 00:34:20,860
Could it be that my own brother's illness,

463
00:34:20,989 --> 00:34:23,110
which concerns the safety of the world,

464
00:34:23,110 --> 00:34:26,420
cannot be known to me at all?

465
00:34:33,170 --> 00:34:35,940
The prescription you sent
through Hai Shou—

466
00:34:36,260 --> 00:34:39,650
I have already asked
the Imperial Medical Bureau to study it carefully.

467
00:34:39,650 --> 00:34:41,310
It is indeed the right remedy,

468
00:34:42,989 --> 00:34:44,570
but it is too strong.

469
00:34:44,690 --> 00:34:45,320
The medicinal properties are too fierce—

470
00:34:45,320 --> 00:34:47,960
Since Your Majesty
mentioned the prescription,

471
00:34:47,960 --> 00:34:48,739
I

472
00:34:49,320 --> 00:34:50,219
am willing to guarantee it
with the lives of my entire clan

473
00:34:50,219 --> 00:34:52,690
of more than 40 people.

474
00:34:53,340 --> 00:34:54,900
If Heaven does not bless us,

475
00:34:55,610 --> 00:34:57,270
and those unspeakable things

476
00:34:57,940 --> 00:34:59,780
really happen,

477
00:35:00,990 --> 00:35:03,690
I will pay with the lives
of my whole family.

478
00:35:04,150 --> 00:35:05,010
How about that?

479
00:35:06,050 --> 00:35:06,780
Pay?

480
00:35:07,340 --> 00:35:07,840
Yes.

481
00:35:10,990 --> 00:35:11,900
Life

482
00:35:13,400 --> 00:35:16,010
can never be paid like this.

483
00:35:18,090 --> 00:35:19,490
Do you really think I

484
00:35:20,190 --> 00:35:21,990
would gamble His Majesty's life

485
00:35:22,110 --> 00:35:24,800
against the lives of your whole family?

486
00:35:27,030 --> 00:35:29,440
How do I know if the prescription
you presented

487
00:35:29,440 --> 00:35:31,570
is to save his life or to take it?

488
00:35:31,670 --> 00:35:32,190
Hey—

489
00:35:34,110 --> 00:35:35,500
How can the safety of the Emperor

490
00:35:35,500 --> 00:35:38,020
be decided by a woman and a few eunuchs

491
00:35:39,410 --> 00:35:41,250
in a private room?

492
00:35:45,780 --> 00:35:46,580
Fule Brothel?

493
00:35:47,090 --> 00:35:48,150
At a time like this,

494
00:35:48,470 --> 00:35:49,570
why are we going to a brothel?

495
00:35:49,570 --> 00:35:51,830
To get a pass to leave the city,
of course.

496
00:35:52,050 --> 00:35:52,800
Big Radish,

497
00:35:53,010 --> 00:35:54,270
can you play the guqin?

498
00:35:57,100 --> 00:35:58,430
Master Wu, you're here.

499
00:35:58,510 --> 00:35:59,110
Master Wu.

500
00:36:00,040 --> 00:36:00,570
Careful.

501
00:36:00,710 --> 00:36:01,570
Please come in.

502
00:36:08,670 --> 00:36:09,470
Rectifier Yu.

503
00:36:09,540 --> 00:36:10,270
Yes.

504
00:36:11,340 --> 00:36:12,530
Send these two away.

505
00:36:13,880 --> 00:36:14,490
All right.

506
00:36:19,380 --> 00:36:19,860
Here.

507
00:36:20,300 --> 00:36:21,070
-Thank you, sir.
-Thank you, sir.

508
00:36:21,070 --> 00:36:22,800
We are not getting off the boat.

509
00:36:23,670 --> 00:36:24,530
Go.

510
00:36:26,010 --> 00:36:26,940
Let's go.

511
00:36:27,570 --> 00:36:29,420
♪ Along the Qinhuai River in Nanjing ♪

512
00:36:29,480 --> 00:36:31,410
♪ I patrol the streets,
swaying along day after day ♪

513
00:36:31,590 --> 00:36:33,540
♪ A jug of wine in hand,
a blade of grass between my teeth ♪

514
00:36:33,560 --> 00:36:35,720
♪ Even the rowdiest ghosts run
when they see me ♪

515
00:36:35,740 --> 00:36:37,610
♪ Through storms and flames, I press on ♪

516
00:36:37,710 --> 00:36:39,860
♪ I drag my life along like a rope ♪

517
00:36:39,880 --> 00:36:41,740
♪ They call me a young constable ♪

518
00:36:41,990 --> 00:36:43,930
♪ But this realm isn't mine to rule ♪

519
00:36:42,690 --> 00:36:43,650
Xiaohong!

520
00:36:44,000 --> 00:36:46,570
♪ But this realm isn't mine to rule ♪

521
00:36:44,200 --> 00:36:45,050
Coming.

522
00:36:45,530 --> 00:36:46,420
Sir.

523
00:36:48,400 --> 00:36:49,690
You're just going to walk away?

524
00:36:49,690 --> 00:36:50,780
You really don't know what's good for you,
do you?

525
00:36:50,780 --> 00:36:51,400
If I can't leave,

526
00:36:51,400 --> 00:36:52,780
I'll chop off my own fingers,

527
00:36:52,780 --> 00:36:53,510
so I can't play the guqin.

528
00:36:53,510 --> 00:36:55,050
You can just treat me as a cripple
and support me from now on.

529
00:36:55,050 --> 00:36:56,190
Didn't I already send someone

530
00:36:56,190 --> 00:36:57,830
to give you 150 taels?

531
00:36:58,840 --> 00:37:00,650
150 taels?

532
00:37:01,670 --> 00:37:02,780
You have more nerve than your father.

533
00:37:02,780 --> 00:37:04,340
Don't mention my father again!

534
00:37:04,340 --> 00:37:05,370
Your father promised me

535
00:37:05,370 --> 00:37:06,690
at least 2,000 taels.

536
00:37:07,510 --> 00:37:09,730
-Mention him again!
-What are you doing?

537
00:37:09,730 --> 00:37:10,900
What are you doing?

538
00:37:15,970 --> 00:37:16,740
Aunt Hong...

539
00:37:20,220 --> 00:37:21,220
Can I borrow...

540
00:37:23,070 --> 00:37:24,300
your Xiyueqin?

541
00:37:25,570 --> 00:37:26,370
What's wrong?

542
00:37:28,010 --> 00:37:29,810
Are you unable to leave the city?

543
00:37:30,220 --> 00:37:31,820
Why are you leaving the city?

544
00:37:34,340 --> 00:37:35,460
What happened?

545
00:37:38,220 --> 00:37:39,050
Aunt Hong...

546
00:37:40,490 --> 00:37:41,260
Father...

547
00:37:42,400 --> 00:37:43,220
My father...

548
00:37:43,670 --> 00:37:45,170
He... Father is gone.

549
00:37:49,870 --> 00:37:51,070
Father is gone.

550
00:38:04,800 --> 00:38:06,080
What did you just say?

551
00:38:12,590 --> 00:38:14,250
What happened to your father?

552
00:38:16,130 --> 00:38:17,300
What did you do?

553
00:38:22,420 --> 00:38:24,280
I couldn't... couldn't save him.

554
00:38:24,500 --> 00:38:26,330
I failed to save him.

555
00:38:27,940 --> 00:38:28,570
Then...

556
00:38:31,340 --> 00:38:32,860
Where is he now?

557
00:38:34,760 --> 00:38:36,020
He was perfectly fine.

558
00:38:36,800 --> 00:38:38,820
How could he just be gone?

559
00:38:39,960 --> 00:38:41,090
I... I...

560
00:38:42,970 --> 00:38:44,220
You just left him?

561
00:38:44,630 --> 00:38:45,090
Then...

562
00:38:45,550 --> 00:38:47,940
Why did you come here?

563
00:38:48,300 --> 00:38:49,030
Aunt Hong...

564
00:38:49,510 --> 00:38:50,380
Aunt Hong...

565
00:38:52,090 --> 00:38:52,970
Aunt Hong...

566
00:39:14,050 --> 00:39:15,530
What are you going there for?

567
00:39:15,530 --> 00:39:16,510
This is Fule Brothel.

568
00:39:16,510 --> 00:39:17,420
You can't go in.

569
00:39:17,820 --> 00:39:18,860
Let go.

570
00:39:19,670 --> 00:39:20,380
I won't!

571
00:39:20,590 --> 00:39:21,360
Let go!

572
00:39:21,400 --> 00:39:22,050
I won't!

573
00:39:22,240 --> 00:39:23,300
How dare you!

574
00:39:27,320 --> 00:39:28,380
Remember this.

575
00:39:28,690 --> 00:39:30,740
If I don't come out in half an hour,

576
00:39:31,490 --> 00:39:33,130
burn this place down.

577
00:39:34,550 --> 00:39:35,610
Do you understand?

578
00:39:46,090 --> 00:39:48,610
Sir, come see me again next time.

579
00:39:48,740 --> 00:39:49,900
Of course, Lanzhi.

580
00:39:54,440 --> 00:39:58,430
♪ The Golden Hall stands grand and wide ♪

581
00:39:58,490 --> 00:40:02,260
♪ Towers shrouded
deep in clouds and mist ♪

582
00:39:59,220 --> 00:40:01,150
You'll know when you see him later.

583
00:40:02,330 --> 00:40:06,550
♪ They call me the Crown Prince ♪

584
00:40:06,580 --> 00:40:10,440
♪ But I hide by the Qinhuai River ♪

585
00:40:09,460 --> 00:40:10,300
I read the poem Mr. Li wrote here

586
00:40:10,300 --> 00:40:12,010
the day before yesterday.

587
00:40:10,690 --> 00:40:14,530
♪ Those high in court know
nothing of the world below ♪

588
00:40:12,110 --> 00:40:13,090
He is quite talented.

589
00:40:13,090 --> 00:40:13,820
Yes.

590
00:40:14,550 --> 00:40:18,760
♪ The storms outside
are just tales to them ♪

591
00:40:17,050 --> 00:40:19,010
The artistic conception
is profound and lingering.

592
00:40:18,800 --> 00:40:22,730
♪ Take off this robe,
and I'm just a stranger ♪

593
00:40:22,760 --> 00:40:26,990
♪ Only then did I realize
how vast this world is ♪

594
00:40:27,020 --> 00:40:30,390
♪ They call me a naive old mule ♪

595
00:40:30,760 --> 00:40:34,740
♪ Laughing at my honest heart
that doesn't know how to dodge ♪

596
00:40:34,900 --> 00:40:38,990
♪ Do not laugh at me for
stumbling my way here ♪

597
00:40:39,020 --> 00:40:43,110
♪ Whose life isn't hanging by a thread? ♪

598
00:40:43,140 --> 00:40:48,640
♪ Whose life isn't hanging by a thread? ♪

599
00:40:47,160 --> 00:40:47,890
Who are you—

600
00:40:47,910 --> 00:40:48,500
Shut up.

601
00:40:53,860 --> 00:40:55,260
Before your father died,

602
00:40:55,320 --> 00:40:56,720
what else did he tell you?

603
00:40:57,470 --> 00:40:58,260
He said

604
00:41:00,280 --> 00:41:01,570
he wanted me to live.

605
00:41:02,570 --> 00:41:03,320
He also said

606
00:41:03,590 --> 00:41:04,920
I should leave Jinling.

607
00:41:06,130 --> 00:41:07,880
I don't understand what he meant.

608
00:41:07,880 --> 00:41:08,800
I don't get it.

609
00:41:11,530 --> 00:41:12,490
I do.

610
00:41:13,760 --> 00:41:15,720
Just do as your father said.

611
00:41:19,290 --> 00:41:22,180
I exchanged the money your father
left me over all these years

612
00:41:22,180 --> 00:41:23,970
for this bag of Hepu pearls.

613
00:41:24,600 --> 00:41:25,350
Take it.

614
00:41:28,530 --> 00:41:30,390
My father left this money for you.

615
00:41:30,780 --> 00:41:31,640
I can't take it.

616
00:41:32,970 --> 00:41:34,420
Your father is dead.

617
00:41:38,550 --> 00:41:40,050
What's the point

618
00:41:41,110 --> 00:41:42,370
of keeping this money?

619
00:41:45,860 --> 00:41:46,650
Aunt Hong.

620
00:41:48,260 --> 00:41:50,460
Was my father hiding something from me?

621
00:41:57,190 --> 00:41:58,990
Since none of you want to tell me,

622
00:42:00,170 --> 00:42:02,340
I'll find the answer myself.

623
00:42:02,690 --> 00:42:03,420
Take care.

624
00:42:11,170 --> 00:42:12,300
Your father is dead.

625
00:42:13,030 --> 00:42:15,610
These things died with him too.

626
00:42:30,380 --> 00:42:30,840
My Lord.

627
00:42:31,280 --> 00:42:32,920
All reserves of the Brave Warriors Camp
are present.

628
00:42:32,920 --> 00:42:34,110
The prefectural office vanguard reports.

629
00:42:34,110 --> 00:42:34,800
Just now,

630
00:42:34,820 --> 00:42:36,250
in Granny Tong's room at Fule Brothel,

631
00:42:36,250 --> 00:42:37,300
there were 4 visitors.

632
00:42:37,300 --> 00:42:39,160
The leader was Wu Buping's son.

633
00:42:39,610 --> 00:42:40,440
Wu Dingyuan?

634
00:42:41,030 --> 00:42:42,430
That good-for-nothing?

635
00:42:42,840 --> 00:42:43,440
Yes.

636
00:42:43,910 --> 00:42:46,380
The one who saved the Crown Prince
at Dongshui Pass that day

637
00:42:46,380 --> 00:42:47,980
was this good-for-nothing.

638
00:42:48,280 --> 00:42:50,860
He was the one who sent
the Crown Prince to the Imperial Guards.

639
00:42:50,860 --> 00:42:52,590
It seems I underestimated him.

640
00:42:53,550 --> 00:42:54,990
Hurry back to the palace now.

641
00:42:54,990 --> 00:42:56,720
Have someone write a memorial,

642
00:42:56,900 --> 00:42:58,960
saying the Crown Prince
succumbed to his severe injuries

643
00:42:58,960 --> 00:43:00,240
and passed away today.

644
00:43:00,720 --> 00:43:02,650
But... the Crown Prince hasn't...

645
00:43:02,880 --> 00:43:05,480
There is no turning back
once the arrow is shot.

646
00:43:05,720 --> 00:43:06,320
Yes.
